# cell of its column, and a paragraph break inside the replay -- \raggedright
# after a font switch, or a blank line between rows -- ends the switch there:
# the cell became an empty bold paragraph, then its text unbolded, and the
# table fell back to HTML. The filter restores the cell as TeX sets it: the
# empty paragraph goes and its formatting wraps the text that followed. A cell
# the shim collapsed from \multicolumn keeps only its own formatting. Bold
